 026
DESCRIPTION:The Krzyzowa Foundation's Konrad and Pawel Jarodzki Artist-in-R
 esidence Programme hosts an artist for six weeks (21 September to 31 Octob
 er 2026) at the historic Krzyzowa estate in Lower Silesia\, providing acco
 mmodation\, financial support\, and a production budget (amounts not publi
 shed on the call page). ELIGIBILITY: residents of Creative Europe countrie
 s other than Poland. Deadline 31 July 2026.\n\nOrganisation: Krzyzowa Foun
 dation for Mutual Understanding in Europe\nLocation: Krzyzowa\, Poland. Fo
 r residents of Creative Europe countries other than Poland (Netherlands el
 igible).\nAward: Accommodation\, financial support\, and a production budg
 et (amounts not published). 6-week residency. No application fee.\nDuratio
 n: Residency 21 September to 31 October 2026.\n\nMore: https://krzyzowa.pl
 /pl/projekty/rekrutacje/5357-open-call-konrad-i-pawel-jarodzki-artist-in-r
